1
00:00:00,236 --> 00:00:01,446
(Leonard:)Uh-oh.

2
00:00:01,696 --> 00:00:02,826
(Penny:)What?

3
00:00:02,989 --> 00:00:06,659
(Leonard:)We got an email from the East Rutherford,
New Jersey, Gay, Lesbian, Bisexual...

4
00:00:06,826 --> 00:00:09,366
(Leonard:)...and Transgender Alliance.

5
00:00:10,288 --> 00:00:12,628
They want another 1000 Penny Blossoms.

6
00:00:13,083 --> 00:00:16,753
- Really?
- One-day rush.

7
00:00:17,253 --> 00:00:20,753
I really need to take that off the website.

8
00:00:21,299 --> 00:00:24,139
Okay, well, guess we better get started.

9
00:00:24,302 --> 00:00:26,012
(Howard:)You can't be serious.

10
00:00:26,930 --> 00:00:30,930
But, come on. What about
the living organism of the work force...

11
00:00:31,101 --> 00:00:33,141
...and the American spirit?

12
00:00:33,311 --> 00:00:36,731
(Penny:)And Jiminy Crockett at the Alamo?

13
00:00:37,190 --> 00:00:41,190
(Sheldon:)Davy Crockett.
Jiminy Crockett was a cricket.

14
00:00:41,611 --> 00:00:44,701
(Penny:)Yes, I know that, okay? I'm tired
and I've had 18 cups of coffee.

15
00:00:44,864 --> 00:00:49,494
(Penny:)The point is, if we all just pull together,
we can do this. Who's with me?

16
00:00:53,748 --> 00:01:03,018
(Howard:)Penny, although you may find it hard
to believe, we do have lives.

